{
  "analytics_identifier": null,
  "base_path": "/government/publications/guidance-on-libraries-as-a-statutory-service",
  "content_id": "a9afc998-47e0-41be-a344-9ecc3d82ba44",
  "description": "This guidance is intended to help councils in England and others in considering library service provision as a statutory service.\r\n\r\n",
  "details": {
    "attachments": [
      {
        "attachment_type": "html",
        "command_paper_number": "",
        "hoc_paper_number": "",
        "id": "8440524",
        "isbn": "",
        "title": "Libraries as a statutory service",
        "unique_reference": "",
        "unnumbered_command_paper": false,
        "unnumbered_hoc_paper": false,
        "url": "/government/publications/guidance-on-libraries-as-a-statutory-service/libraries-as-a-statutory-service"
      }
    ],
    "body": "<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>This document provides guidance on councils’ duty to provide a comprehensive and efficient library service.</p>\n\n<p>The information contained in this document is provided to help guide local councils and others. This text should not in any way be taken as formal legal advice or be used as the basis for formal council decisions. All councils should seek their own legal advice on any proposed changes they wish to make to their library service.</p>\n\n<p>We would like councils considering changing their library service to inform the DCMS Libraries team about their proposals before public engagement or consultation. Details about such proposals should be emailed to: <a href=\"mailto:libraries@dcms.gov.uk\">libraries@dcms.gov.uk</a></p>\n\n<p>It sets out:</p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>what the law says about the public library responsibilities of the Department for  Culture, Media and Sport (DCMS), Ministry of Housing, Communities and Local Government (MHCLG), and councils</li>\n  <li>how to make representations about whether the council is meeting its statutory duties</li>\n  <li>the process DCMS will follow to consider formal complaints</li>\n</ul>\n\n<p>This guidance accompanies the <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/longer-term-evidence-based-sustainable-planning-toolkit\">Strategic planning: longer-term, evidence-based sustainable planning toolkit</a> produced by the Libraries Taskforce.</p>\n</div>",
